#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:139
msgid "Open a device to edit its settings. Fixed IPv4, port forwards and DDNS are separate settings."
msgstr "打开某台设备编辑设置。固定 IPv4、端口映射和 DDNS 分开配置。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:141
msgid "Start with LAN or WAN. After a LAN address change, reconnect to the router at its new address."
msgstr "先找到要配置的 LAN 或 WAN。更改 LAN 地址后，请用新地址重新连接路由器。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:143
msgid "Choose the Wi-Fi network you want to edit. Changing its name or password may disconnect wireless clients."
msgstr "选择需要修改的 Wi-Fi 网络。修改名称或密码可能断开无线设备。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:145
msgid "Choose the relevant interface before changing address assignment or DNS settings."
msgstr "先确认接口，再更改地址分配或 DNS 设置。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:148
msgid "Choose the source and destination zones before editing rules. Open Port Forwards to publish a specific port."
msgstr "编辑规则前先确认来源与目标区域。要开放指定端口，请前往端口映射。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:150
msgid "A port forward sends traffic from one external port to a chosen internal IP and port. Use a stable destination address."
msgstr "端口映射会把一个外部端口的流量转给指定的内网 IP 和端口。请使用稳定的目标地址。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:152
msgid "Check the resolved address and last update. Creating a DNS record does not itself publish a Web service."
msgstr "检查解析地址和最近一次更新。创建 DNS 记录不会自动对外发布 Web 服务。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:154
msgid "Set up a delivery channel first, then choose which events should send notifications."
msgstr "先设置投递渠道，再选择哪些事件需要发送通知。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:156
msgid "Issuing a certificate and deploying it to a service are separate steps. Check both states."
msgstr "签发证书和将证书部署到服务是两步，请分别检查状态。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:158
msgid "Start here for router identity and time settings. Open Administration for access settings."
msgstr "在这里设置路由器名称和时间。访问方式请在管理访问中设置。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:161
msgid "Check how you will get back into the router before changing an access method."
msgstr "更改访问方式前，先确认如何重新登录路由器。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/argon-common-pages.js:163
msgid "Download a configuration backup before starting an upgrade."
msgstr "开始升级前，请先下载配置备份。"

